핑, 스노클링 명소부터 반려 동물 동반 해변인 ‘펫 비치’와 서핑 포인트까지, 꼭 동해선 열차 여행이 아니어도 모두 7번 국도(동해대로) 따라 달려 가볼 수 있는 곳이어서 올여름 휴가 버킷리스트에 추가해볼 만하다.","date":"2025-07-11T15:35:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/07/12/N524P2CNJBH6HAUUBWT46YDVQY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"“지지직, 토도독… 오늘도 이 음악 덕에 버팁니다”","partialText":"","date":"2025-07-11T15:34:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/07/12/YPYMYSLV2JCTJATOB2NGFVQ5QM/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"더 시원한 ‘숲세권’… 같은 서울이지만 온도 차 최대 4.2도","partialText":"","date":"2025-07-11T15:54:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/national_general/2025/07/12/4Z53CWU7YFHBJMJK4DSLQASJRU/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"폭염 피하려다 냉방병...적정 온도 지키고 자주 환기해야","partialText":"","date":"2025-07-12T01:53:47.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/national_general/2025/07/12/OSB7WJKLQNGTDO3TIWTX4QC23Y/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"체감온도 35도, 주말 전국 대부분 ‘폭염 특보’","partialText":"","date":"2025-07-12T00:22:16.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/education/2025/07/12/RKBNC6RFBFBZBO3XPO47JDBULY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["